        <item>
            <title>0.15.85</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:11:29 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>246</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.85</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Corder now uses almost no energy while its window is closed or hidden. Before, the hidden window kept checking for updates to settings several times a second for as long as the app ran.</li>
<li>Call detection does less work: it only looks at the microphone when a meeting app is open, and never makes the menu or windows wait on it.</li>
<li>Archived meetings are deleted after 7 days even if you never quit Corder, and old downloads are cleaned up regularly.</li>
<li>The diagnostics log no longer grows without limit.</li>
<li>A stuck network request (summary, chapters, title, cloud audio) no longer freezes the Library window; it gives up after a few minutes instead.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
